# AIDLC vs Release Compliance Tracker - Comprehensive Gap Analysis & Migration Assessment

## Objective

Perform a detailed comparison between the **AIDLC (AI Driven Lifecycle)** project and the **Release Compliance Tracker (SOX Compliance Release Tracker)** project.

The goal is **NOT** to determine which project is better.

The objective is to understand:

- What capabilities already exist in AIDLC.
- What capabilities are missing in AIDLC.
- Which Release Tracker features should be migrated into AIDLC.
- Whether there are overlapping implementations.
- Whether existing implementations can be enhanced instead of duplicated.
- Provide an implementation roadmap for migrating the Release Tracker capabilities into AIDLC.

